   "widgets_values": [
    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-chroma-t2i, with only the changes needed for this test. Both prompts count 44 tokens: an even count the sequence-parallel shard divides with no pad row, and an equal pair the cfg path needs no mask for, so this graph reaches uly2 and uly2+fsdp with neither. The shipped pair is even as well, at 100 and 28, but unequal, so cfg2 pads and masks it."
   ],
